======
TILES
======

suelo " " USES arte_suelo
pared "#" USES arte_pared BLOCKS
objetivo "." USES arte_objetivo

========
OBJECTS
========

caja USES arte_caja ON_GOAL arte_caja_colocada

=======
PLAYER
=======

WALK RIGHT walk_right_1 walk_right_2
WALK LEFT MIRROR RIGHT
WALK UP walk_up_1 walk_up_2
WALK DOWN MIRROR UP

=======
LEGEND
=======

"@" = PLAYER ON suelo
"+" = PLAYER ON objetivo
"$" = caja ON suelo
"*" = caja ON objetivo

====
WIN
====

ALL caja ON objetivo

=======
SOUNDS
=======

MOVE NR1 0 129 67 115 134
PUSH NR1 0 193 98 96 135
ON_GOAL NR2 0 129 115 89 135
COMPLETE NR3 128 192 32 50 199

